+The chest model also converged at full rank. The AR(1) correction reduced
+overall lag-1 residual correlation from
+`r fmt_number(filter(residual_acf, run_id == chest_id, stage == "preliminary_no_AR1", lag_30_minute_bins == 1)$correlation, 3)`
+to
+`r fmt_number(filter(residual_acf, run_id == chest_id, stage == "final_AR1_standardized", lag_30_minute_bins == 1)$correlation, 3)`.
+Its basis-size checks were acceptable. The same lower-bound pattern,
+non-normal tails, fitted-dependent residual spread, and high overlap between
+the global and site nonlinear terms (concurvity) remain. The chest model is
+therefore corroborating evidence with
+the same interpretive limitations as the near-eye model.
